nrs-edge 0.1.0: stereo depth network by Necessity Robotics
Copyright 2026 Necessity Robotics

Weights and scripts of nrs-edge: Apache-2.0.

The weights were trained by Necessity Robotics. No other group's model weights and no ImageNet weights were used.

This release contains or is derived from these third-party works:

* LiteAnyStereo (github.com/TomTomTommi/LiteAnyStereo, commit 8c97bd4): network design and code,
  unmodified (third_party/LiteAnyStereo in the code repository). MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2025 Junpeng Jing.
* PyTorch Image Models (timm, Apache-2.0; LICENSES/timm_Apache-2.0.txt): the FasterNet-T0 definition.
* FasterNet (Microsoft Corporation, MIT License, as stated in the timm source).

Citations (Lite Any Stereo v1 and v2, DLNR, RAFT-Stereo): see ATTRIBUTION.md.

